  "summary": "Malicious code in ndmcjcxiebysfdb (npm)",
  "details": "The package ships a single obfuscated HTML page (index.html) that impersonates a Cloudflare Turnstile \"please wait / security verification\" challenge. The page loads the real Turnstile widget and embeds an AES key, a host key, and a Turnstile site key; once a visitor completes the challenge, the script redirects them to a phishing destination derived from those keys. It is a credential-harvesting phishing page distributed as an npm package.",
